  "description": "Five 3 min reps that rise 0.3 km/h each rep from 10.4 to 11.6 km/h (level 1), 2.5 min jogs: teaches pacing up to your top sustainable speed. Needs --running-mode, handrail up. See docs/treadmill/VO2MAX.md.",
